AERONAUTICAL INFORMATION DISCLAIMER

EasyDABS is an unofficial, independent project. It is not affiliated with,
endorsed by, or operated on behalf of skyguide, the Swiss Federal Office of
Civil Aviation (FOCA), the Swiss Armed Forces, or Skybriefing.

The airspace information shown by EasyDABS is derived automatically from the
official Daily Airspace Bulletin Switzerland (DABS) PDF. Automated parsing can
fail, misread, omit or misplace information, and the displayed data may be
outdated, incomplete or incorrect. EasyDABS is provided for situational
awareness only and is NOT a substitute for official aeronautical information.

It must not be used as the sole or primary source for flight planning,
navigation, or any other operational or safety-related decision. The official
DABS publication on https://www.skybriefing.com, together with the applicable
NOTAMs and AIP, remains the sole authoritative source. Pilots and operators
remain fully responsible for obtaining and checking all official information
before and during every flight.

To the maximum extent permitted by applicable law, the authors accept no
liability whatsoever for any loss, damage, injury, airspace infringement, fine
or other consequence arising from the use of, or reliance on, EasyDABS or the
information it displays.

The MIT License above applies to the EasyDABS source code. It does not grant
any rights in the official DABS publications or other third-party data and map
tiles (e.g. swisstopo, OpenStreetMap), which remain subject to their respective
owners' terms.
